    "images_with_text_scrolling_A4yLa8": {
      "type": "images-with-text-scrolling",
      "blocks": {
        "item_9HK6tM": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/a-japanese-retail-executive-in-a-store-reviewing-a-checklist.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Layer 01: Precision Sensing",
            "content": "<p>Most retail systems inflate traffic data by counting employees as customers. Flow’s AI-driven sensing identifies and subtracts staff movement in real-time.<br/><br/>Gain 100% accurate <strong>Net Customer Traffic</strong> and <strong>True Conversion Rates</strong>. Without filtering staff, metrics are based on noise, not reality.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_4Jg6dW": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/analytics_mobile.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Layer 02: Unified Analytics",
            "content": "<p>Data is useless in a vacuum. The <strong>FIDA Framework</strong> aggregates fragmented data—including POS Sales, Labor Schedules, Weather, and Marketing Calendars—into a single source of truth.</p><p>FIDA answers the \"Why\" behind performance gaps, identifying whether issues stem from storefront capture (VMD), conversion (staffing), or external factors.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_a8jn8N": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/store_environmnet_x_1500_x_1900_px.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Layer 03: Decision Intelligence",
            "content": "<p>We reduce response latency from <strong>18 hours to under 10 minutes</strong>. Instead of asking managers to analyze complex dashboards, Flow Assistant pushes prioritized, actionable tasks directly to their mobile devices.</p><p>Standardize excellence across the organization. Every store manager follows the same high-quality decision logic based on real-time opportunities.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
